{
  "id": "PSA.59",
  "number": "59",
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "reference": "Psalms 59",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 17,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "59",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 59"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "59",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "d"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "To the chief Musician, Al-taschith, Michtam of David; when Saul sent, and they watched the house to kill him.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 59:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deliver me from mine enemies, O my God: defend me from them that rise up against me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 59:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deliver me from the workers of iniquity, and save me from bloody men.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 59:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For, lo, they lie in wait for my soul: the mighty are gathered against me; not",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "for",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.59.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.59.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my transgression, nor",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "for",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.59.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.59.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my sin, O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.59.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.59.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 59:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They run and prepare themselves without",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "my",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.59.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.59.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fault: awake to help me, and behold.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 59:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou therefore, O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.59.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.59.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God of hosts, the God of Israel, awake to visit all the heathen: be not merciful to any wicked transgressors. Selah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 59:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They return at evening: they make a noise like a dog, and go round about the city.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 59:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, they belch out with their mouth: swords",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.59.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.59.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in their lips: for who,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "say they",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.59.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.59.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", doth hear?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 59:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But thou, O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.59.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.59.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", shalt laugh at them; thou shalt have all the heathen in derision.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 59:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Because of",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.59.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.59.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "his strength will I wait upon thee: for God",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.59.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.59.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my defence.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 59:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The God of my mercy shall prevent me: God shall let me see",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "my desire",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.59.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.59.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "upon mine enemies.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 59:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slay them not, lest my people forget: scatter them by thy power; and bring them down, O Lord our shield.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 59:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "For",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.59.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.59.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the sin of their mouth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.59.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.59.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the words of their lips let them even be taken in their pride: and for cursing and lying",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.59.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.59.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "they speak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 59:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Consume",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "them",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.59.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.59.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in wrath, consume",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "them",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.59.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.59.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", that they",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "may",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.59.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.59.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "be:",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.59.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.59.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and let them know that God ruleth in Jacob unto the ends of the earth. Selah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 59:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And at evening let them return;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.59.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.59.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "let them make a noise like a dog, and go round about the city.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 59:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let them wander up and down for meat, and grudge if they be not satisfied.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
